==Trivia==
This card features a special pattern behind its card text, which is shared with {{TCG ID|Triumphant Light|Arceus ex|71}} and eight other Pokémon in the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion, all eight of which have a {{TCGP|Link Ability}} that is active or usable while any Arceus card is in play. All cards are also part of the "Pokémon with Abilities that "Link" with Arceus" [[Triumphant Light (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]].

===Origin===
*'''Power Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Movie VS Pack|Butler's Salamence|11}} from the {{TCG|Movie Commemoration VS Pack}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

